<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Nancy 💖</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6e7,#ffc0cb,#ffe4ef);
min-height:100vh;
overflow-x:hidden;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
padding:20px;
}

.container{
width:100%;
max-width:450px;
background:white;
border-radius:30px;
padding:25px;
text-align:center;
box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(255,105,180,.3);
animation:pop .8s ease;
position:relative;
z-index:2;
}

@keyframes pop{
from{
opacity:0;
transform:scale(.8);
}
to{
opacity:1;
transform:scale(1);
}
}

.title{
font-size:32px;
font-weight:700;
color:#ff4fa2;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.subtitle{
color:#ff69b4;
font-weight:600;
margin-bottom:15px;
}

.cake{
font-size:90px;
animation:bounce 2s infinite;
}

@keyframes bounce{
0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}
50%{transform:translateY(-12px);}
}

.message{
margin-top:15px;
line-height:1.8;
color:#555;
font-size:15px;
}

.highlight{
color:#ff4fa2;
font-weight:700;
}

button{
width:100%;
padding:14px;
margin-top:12px;
border:none;
border-radius:30px;
cursor:pointer;
font-size:15px;
font-weight:600;
transition:.3s;
}

.btn1{
background:#ff69b4;
color:white;
}

.btn2{
background:white;
border:2px solid #ff69b4;
color:#ff69b4;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.04);
}

#giftBox{
display:none;
margin-top:20px;
padding:15px;
background:#fff0f7;
border-radius:20px;
border:2px dashed #ff69b4;
color:#444;
}

.heart{
position:fixed;
font-size:22px;
animation:float linear infinite;
pointer-events:none;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:0;
}
20%{
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-120px);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<audio id="music" loop>
<source src="https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>

<div class="container">

<div class="cake">🎂</div>

<div class="title">Happy Birthday</div>

<div class="subtitle">💖 Nancy, Sweetheart 💖</div>

<div class="message">
Today is your special day and you deserve all the happiness in the world. ✨

<br><br>

May your day be filled with beautiful moments, warm smiles, laughter, sweet surprises and unforgettable memories. 🌸

<br><br>

Thank you for being such a wonderful person. Your kindness, your smile and your presence make life brighter. 💕

<br><br>

I hope this year brings you success, happiness, good health and everything your heart wishes for.

<br><br>

<span class="highlight">
Happy Birthday Nancy! 🎀💗
</span>
</div>

<button class="btn1" onclick="playMusic()">
🎶 Play Birthday Music
</button>

<button class="btn2" onclick="openGift()">
🎁 Open Your Birthday Gift
</button>

<div id="giftBox">
<h3>🎀 Surprise Gift 🎀</h3>
<br>
💖 You are amazing.<br>
🌸 You are appreciated.<br>
✨ You are special.<br>
🎂 And today is all about YOU!
<br><br>
Have the happiest birthday ever, Sweetheart! 💗
</div>

</div>

<script>
function playMusic(){
const music=document.getElementById("music");
music.volume=0.4;
music.play();
}

function openGift(){
document.getElementById("giftBox").style.display="block";
createBurst();
}

for(let i=0;i<25;i++){
createHeart();
}

function createHeart(){
const heart=document.createElement("div");
heart.className="heart";
heart.innerHTML=["💖","💗","🎀","✨"][Math.floor(Math.random()*4)];

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
heart.style.animationDuration=(4+Math.random()*4)+"s";

document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
createHeart();
},8000);
}

function createBurst(){
for(let i=0;i<30;i++){
const h=document.createElement("div");
h.className="heart";
h.innerHTML="💖";
h.style.left=(40+Math.random()*20)+"vw";
h.style.animationDuration="2s";
document.body.appendChild(h);

setTimeout(()=>{
h.remove();
},2000);
}
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
